  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">안녕하세요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">숨은 그림 찾기를 이미지 업로드 해서 만들 수 있는 html 입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">김정식 선생님의 아래 파일에서 AI의 도움을 받았습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/641\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/641</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/641\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=F1n&amp;datanum=641\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/641\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/641\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">방식은 2가지 있는데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그림마다 윤곽선이 잘 뜨는 게 달라서 둘 다 해보시고 사용하시면 됩니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">임계값을 조절하셔서 대략적으로 큰 그림을 만드시고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">편집 모드 누르신 뒤 디테일하게 수정하시면 편하게 제작 가능하십니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05a02a65c8a747cac4851de9bf85b4ea51101d9b?download\" data-file-name=\"숨은 그림 찾기.html\" data-file-size=\"51099\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D380%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20260318134704&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F05a02a65c8a747cac4851de9bf85b4ea51101d9b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">숨은 그림 찾기</span><span class=\"type\">.html</span></div><div class=\"size\">49.90KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">혹시나 궁금하신 건 댓글 달아주십시오.<br>공유 및 코드 수정 편하게 하셔도 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1619ad59762fc3d50b9a2f1057947b08c0434028\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1619ad59762fc3d50b9a2f1057947b08c0434028\" data-origin-width=\"1252\" data-origin-height=\"1388\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22a02a78ede40d11d36667c3e12fb892451a2047\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22a02a78ede40d11d36667c3e12fb892451a2047\" data-origin-width=\"1226\" data-origin-height=\"1178\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
